# Stash Onboarding Flow Completed Walkthrough

All core onboarding requirements, design guidelines, and technical parameters outlined in the PRD, ARCHITECTURE, and DESIGN files have been met. The app is 100% type-safe, built with NativeWind styling, Zustand store state management, and contains premium micro-animations.

## 📱 Screens & Routing Architecture

The complete `(auth)` group stack transitions and directories have been created under `stash/app`:

- **Auth Stack Layout** ([_layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/_layout.tsx)): Establishes Stack router animation configs.
- **Splash Screen** ([splash.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/splash.tsx)): Centered branding, typography overlays, continuous floating preview cards (representing saved bookmark types), and navigation paths.
- **Sign Up / Sign In Screens** ([sign-up.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/sign-up.tsx), [sign-in.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/sign-in.tsx)): Dark form inputs with secure text entry, Supabase Auth hook integration, error styling, and custom Demo mode hooks.
- **"How Did You Find Us" Questionnaire** ([how-found.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/onboarding/how-found.tsx)): High-fidelity interactive discovery options (TikTok, Instagram, Peer, Other) supporting scale triggers and store synchronization.
- **Data Import Validator** ([import.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/onboarding/import.tsx)): Dual select buttons, collapsible help guidelines for exporting settings, full integration with `expo-document-picker` parsing file outputs, and a Developer simulator loading 50+ mock items.
- **AI Organiser Pipeline** ([processing.tsx](file:///c:/Users/IBRAHIM%20QOYUM/OneDrive/Documents/Stash/stash/app/%28auth%29/onboarding/processing.tsx)): Smoothly updating status statements ("Vectorizing captions...", "Clustering similarity..."), a custom percentage progress bar, and elegant pulsing layout skeletons.

