## 🚀 How to Run & Verify Locally

1. Open your terminal in the `stash` directory:
   ```powershell
   cd "c:\Users\IBRAHIM QOYUM\OneDrive\Documents\Stash\stash"
   ```
2. Start the Expo Dev server with cleared cache:
   ```powershell
   npx expo start -c
   ```
3. Open on your device or simulator:
   - Tap **`a`** for Android Emulator.
   - Tap **`i`** for iOS Simulator.
   - Scan the QR code using Expo Go on your mobile device.

